  "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><p data-lake-id=\"u4cd9c289\" id=\"u4cd9c289\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc849c92b\" id=\"uc849c92b\">每个 RTOS 任务都有一个任务通知数组。 每条任务通知 都有</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc4d33844\" id=\"uc4d33844\">“挂起”</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue7d328c3\" id=\"ue7d328c3\">或</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue1035578\" id=\"ue1035578\">“非挂起”</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u70279df3\" id=\"u70279df3\">的通知状态， 以及一个 32 位通知值。 常量 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u64c86f4e\" id=\"u64c86f4e\"><span data-lake-id=\"uefed45f5\" id=\"uefed45f5\">configTASK_NOTIFICATION_ARRAY_ENTRIES</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u9d1e827e\" id=\"u9d1e827e\"> 可设置 任务通知数组中的索引数量。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uee6db93e\" id=\"uee6db93e\"><em><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf19e8314\" id=\"uf19e8314\" style=\"color: rgb(32, 32, 32)\">直达任务通知</span></strong></em><span data-lake-id=\"u8edd263f\" id=\"u8edd263f\" style=\"color: rgb(32, 32, 32)\">是直接发送至任务的事件， 而不是通过中间对象 （如队列、事件组或信号量）间接发送至任务的事件。 向任务发送“直达任务通知” 会将目标任务通知设为“挂起”状态。 正如任务可以阻塞中间对象 （如等待信号量可用的信号量），任务也可以阻塞任务通知， 以等待通知状态变为“挂起”。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"fquAC\" id=\"fquAC\"><span data-lake-id=\"udab7010c\" id=\"udab7010c\">使用方式</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u498c38d8\" id=\"u498c38d8\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua732e30d\" id=\"ua732e30d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(32, 32, 32)\">向任务发送“直达任务通知”也可以 </span><a href=\"https://freertos.org/zh-cn-cmn-s/RTOS-task-notifications.html#uses\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u61c88e10\" id=\"u61c88e10\"><span data-lake-id=\"u29e92fc0\" id=\"u29e92fc0\">更新目标通知的值（可选），可使用下列任一方法</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u76f77ee8\" id=\"u76f77ee8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(32, 32, 32)\">：</span></p><ol list=\"u8bc21c08\"><li fid=\"ud1d54704\" data-lake-id=\"u8b87741f\" id=\"u8b87741f\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue6489642\" id=\"ue6489642\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(32, 32, 32)\">在值中设置一个或多个位。 （ 类似事件组） </span><code data-lake-id=\"u3ea57dfb\" id=\"u3ea57dfb\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf6d9b55f\" id=\"uf6d9b55f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(32, 32, 32)\">eSetBits</span></code></li><li fid=\"ud1d54704\" data-lake-id=\"u98d976b0\" id=\"u98d976b0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u43e5162c\" id=\"u43e5162c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(32, 32, 32)\">对值进行增量（添加 1）。（类似信号量）</span><code data-lake-id=\"ufb0f5d29\" id=\"ufb0f5d29\"><span data-lake-id=\"u01852789\" id=\"u01852789\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(32, 32, 32)\">eIncrement</span></code></li><li fid=\"ud1d54704\" data-lake-id=\"uce2df58b\" id=\"uce2df58b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9d36a541\" id=\"u9d36a541\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(32, 32, 32)\">覆盖原值，无论接收任务是否已读取值。（类似队列）</span><code data-lake-id=\"uc8897be2\" id=\"uc8897be2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0263edd1\" id=\"u0263edd1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(32, 32, 32)\">eSetValueWithOverwrite</span></code></li><li fid=\"ud1d54704\" data-lake-id=\"u525474d9\" id=\"u525474d9\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue94cdfac\" id=\"ue94cdfac\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(32, 32, 32)\">不覆盖原值，若接收任务已读取值后，才可写入。（类似队列）</span><code data-lake-id=\"ubf742aa8\" id=\"ubf742aa8\"><span data-lake-id=\"udf1b6847\" id=\"udf1b6847\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(32, 32, 32)\">eSetValueWithoutOverwrite</span></code></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"ue5bb84b5\" id=\"ue5bb84b5\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua764df5a\" id=\"ua764df5a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(32, 32, 32)\">任务通知API：</span></p><ul list=\"u283eaa9d\"><li fid=\"u5dfbd8c7\" data-lake-id=\"uaf30af02\" id=\"uaf30af02\"><span data-lake-id=\"u64d4f08e\" id=\"u64d4f08e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">发送通知：可以用于任务和中断函数</span></li><li fid=\"u5dfbd8c7\" data-lake-id=\"u15313518\" id=\"u15313518\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua31f15b8\" id=\"ua31f15b8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">接收通知：只能用于任务</span></li></ul><table data-lake-id=\"udgAb\" id=\"udgAb\" margin=\"true\" row-head=\"#FAFAFA;#262626\" col-head=\"#FAFAFA;#262626\" class=\"lake-table\" style=\"width: 741px\"><colgroup><col width=\"117\"><col width=\"216\"><col width=\"158\"><col width=\"250\"></colgroup><tbody><tr data-lake-id=\"u557dafef\" id=\"u557dafef\" style=\"height: 38px\"><td data-lake-id=\"u29e98102\" id=\"u29e98102\"></td><td data-lake-id=\"uc967d73d\" id=\"uc967d73d\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\"><p data-lake-id=\"u23a26ac3\" id=\"u23a26ac3\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span data-lake-id=\"u2dc0d2a0\" id=\"u2dc0d2a0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">API</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u37aee283\" id=\"u37aee283\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\"><p data-lake-id=\"u42ecb7a5\" id=\"u42ecb7a5\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span data-lake-id=\"u34bba09b\" id=\"u34bba09b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">功能</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u15fade63\" id=\"u15fade63\"><p data-lake-id=\"u567e1299\" id=\"u567e1299\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span data-lake-id=\"uff8155b2\" id=\"uff8155b2\">特点</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"ufdaafbc3\" id=\"ufdaafbc3\" style=\"height: 38px\"><td data-lake-id=\"u01f14c62\" id=\"u01f14c62\" rowSpan=\"3\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\"><p data-lake-id=\"u2bbccf73\" id=\"u2bbccf73\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7e548094\" id=\"u7e548094\">发送</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"uebdb65c1\" id=\"uebdb65c1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\"><p data-lake-id=\"u6d0da546\" id=\"u6d0da546\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5235ad59\" id=\"u5235ad59\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">xTaskNotify</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u6e79d554\" id=\"u6e79d554\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\"><p data-lake-id=\"u8626344e\" id=\"u8626344e\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span data-lake-id=\"u64a05f58\" id=\"u64a05f58\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">通知</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"ubf1de1f5\" id=\"ubf1de1f5\"><p data-lake-id=\"u8dadb6c4\" id=\"u8dadb6c4\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue66315e5\" id=\"ue66315e5\">指定不同的通知方式</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u1e74dfa2\" id=\"u1e74dfa2\" style=\"height: 38px\"><td data-lake-id=\"u004b517b\" id=\"u004b517b\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\"><p data-lake-id=\"u2861122d\" id=\"u2861122d\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0a6a0f63\" id=\"u0a6a0f63\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">xTaskNotifyAndQuery</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u9e25138a\" id=\"u9e25138a\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\"><p data-lake-id=\"u8da3deab\" id=\"u8da3deab\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span data-lake-id=\"u372a78e3\" id=\"u372a78e3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">通知并查询</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u5cafde35\" id=\"u5cafde35\"><p data-lake-id=\"u8bfc7fc9\" id=\"u8bfc7fc9\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3db1ee88\" id=\"u3db1ee88\">多一个Query功能</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u1331abe6\" id=\"u1331abe6\"><td data-lake-id=\"uf68a9585\" id=\"uf68a9585\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\"><p data-lake-id=\"ubfcc528c\" id=\"ubfcc528c\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span data-lake-id=\"uec87ec4a\" id=\"uec87ec4a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">xTaskNotifyGive</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u837a94dc\" id=\"u837a94dc\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\"><p data-lake-id=\"ucff4039c\" id=\"ucff4039c\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span data-lake-id=\"u935d1626\" id=\"u935d1626\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">发送信号</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u84022740\" id=\"u84022740\"><p data-lake-id=\"uce07e3fc\" id=\"uce07e3fc\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8ba5cd1d\" id=\"u8ba5cd1d\">信号自增1</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"ue0f3ca56\" id=\"ue0f3ca56\"><td data-lake-id=\"u0766c9c9\" id=\"u0766c9c9\" rowSpan=\"2\"><p data-lake-id=\"u33b9ff15\" id=\"u33b9ff15\" style=\"text-align: center\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"uffc20dbb\" id=\"uffc20dbb\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub3e81056\" id=\"ub3e81056\">接收</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"ub99c57ea\" id=\"ub99c57ea\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\"><p data-lake-id=\"ud7263c55\" id=\"ud7263c55\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span data-lake-id=\"u18115db0\" id=\"u18115db0\">xTaskNotifyWait</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u34780865\" id=\"u34780865\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\"><p data-lake-id=\"uca2437a8\" id=\"uca2437a8\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span data-lake-id=\"u024928df\" id=\"u024928df\">等待任务通知</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u831daedb\" id=\"u831daedb\"><p data-lake-id=\"u4d62016b\" id=\"u4d62016b\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span data-lake-id=\"uba90b096\" id=\"uba90b096\">可清除数据指定位，</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0f186711\" id=\"u0f186711\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span data-lake-id=\"ude0f2b78\" id=\"ude0f2b78\">用作事件组，队列</span></p></td></tr><tr data-lake-id=\"u9a9423d4\" id=\"u9a9423d4\"><td data-lake-id=\"u06cf3fe1\" id=\"u06cf3fe1\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\"><p data-lake-id=\"u59f6cff9\" id=\"u59f6cff9\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3fc9aefc\" id=\"u3fc9aefc\">ulTaskNotifyTake</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u5a3a0024\" id=\"u5a3a0024\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\"><p data-lake-id=\"u10b43de5\" id=\"u10b43de5\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4245158e\" id=\"u4245158e\">获取信号</span></p></td><td data-lake-id=\"u4b6048e4\" id=\"u4b6048e4\"><p data-lake-id=\"uc82b0980\" id=\"uc82b0980\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span data-lake-id=\"uec41d154\" id=\"uec41d154\">可对信号清零或减1，</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u658a8a30\" id=\"u658a8a30\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5419ec97\" id=\"u5419ec97\">用作信号量操作</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><h3 data-lake-id=\"LBxQS\" id=\"LBxQS\"><span data-lake-id=\"u62bdabc6\" id=\"u62bdabc6\">作为轻量级信号量</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"u81391dee\" id=\"u81391dee\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucedeef47\" id=\"ucedeef47\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">使用计数值类型更新任务通知值</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc0793612\" id=\"uc0793612\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue710a159\" id=\"ue710a159\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">发送信号量</span></strong></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22xTaskNotifyGive(task1_handler)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Night%20Owl%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22ax1Dk%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ul list=\"uae11048b\"><li fid=\"u01ed4a2d\" data-lake-id=\"uf2aedb9f\" id=\"uf2aedb9f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u660bfc87\" id=\"u660bfc87\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">参数为TCB任务控制块（任务句柄）</span></li></ul><p data-lake-id=\"uad1f8f59\" id=\"uad1f8f59\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u46ba8c24\" id=\"u46ba8c24\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">接收信号量</span></strong></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22uint32_t%20result%20%3D%20ulTaskNotifyTake(pdTRUE%2C%20portMAX_DELAY)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Night%20Owl%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22PON8K%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ul list=\"u8df7eb45\"><li fid=\"u9fa48ef6\" data-lake-id=\"ue752182b\" id=\"ue752182b\"><span data-lake-id=\"u620e64a3\" id=\"u620e64a3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">参数1：</span><code data-lake-id=\"u12dfeb2d\" id=\"u12dfeb2d\"><span data-lake-id=\"ua2850ed1\" id=\"ua2850ed1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">BaseType_t xClearCountOnExit</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u9ed8465d\" id=\"u9ed8465d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\"> 退出时的数值处理方式</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u8df7eb45\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"u9fa48ef6\" data-lake-id=\"u3ccec45d\" id=\"u3ccec45d\"><code data-lake-id=\"ud8f52920\" id=\"ud8f52920\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3e027eba\" id=\"u3e027eba\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">pdTRUE</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ud211ba5e\" id=\"ud211ba5e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">把通知值清零</span></li><li fid=\"u9fa48ef6\" data-lake-id=\"u4d1ecafc\" id=\"u4d1ecafc\"><code data-lake-id=\"ud8d1002a\" id=\"ud8d1002a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3f0728cb\" id=\"u3f0728cb\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">pdFALSE</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u924ebd32\" id=\"u924ebd32\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">只是把通知值减一</span></li></ul><ul list=\"u8df7eb45\" start=\"2\"><li fid=\"u9fa48ef6\" data-lake-id=\"ud9adf226\" id=\"ud9adf226\"><span data-lake-id=\"ueecc50c0\" id=\"ueecc50c0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">参数2：</span><code data-lake-id=\"ufd20ae73\" id=\"ufd20ae73\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0f1c4c44\" id=\"u0f1c4c44\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">TickType_t xTicksToWait</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uba886505\" id=\"uba886505\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\"> \t等待时长，通常设置为</span><code data-lake-id=\"u7f7698bf\" id=\"u7f7698bf\"><span data-lake-id=\"u03f14485\" id=\"u03f14485\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">portMAX_DELAY</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u19649bb4\" id=\"u19649bb4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">无限等待</span></li></ul><h3 data-lake-id=\"B7t1y\" id=\"B7t1y\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubcc3ded9\" id=\"ubcc3ded9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">作为轻量级邮箱（队列）</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"uc855cd24\" id=\"uc855cd24\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u39428499\" id=\"u39428499\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">发送通知（消息邮箱）</span></strong></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22static%20uint32_t%20ulValue%20%3D%200%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E5%80%BC%5Ct%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E6%A8%A1%E6%8B%9F%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%EF%BC%88%E8%A6%86%E5%86%99%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%89%5CnxTaskNotify(task2_handler%2C%20ulValue%2B%2B%2C%20eSetValueWithOverwrite)%3B%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E6%A8%A1%E6%8B%9F%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%EF%BC%88%E4%B8%8D%E8%A6%86%E5%86%99%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%EF%BC%89%5CnxTaskNotify(task2_handler%2C%20ulValue%2B%2B%2C%20eSetValueWithoutOverwrite)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Night%20Owl%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22xoNnu%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u0d20d4f7\" id=\"u0d20d4f7\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0fae508a\" id=\"u0fae508a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">接收通知</span></strong></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22uint32_t%20notify_val%3B%5CnxTaskNotifyWait(0x00%2C%200xFFFFFFFF%2C%20%26notify_val%2C%20portMAX_DELAY)%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E6%B8%85%E9%9B%B6%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Night%20Owl%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22UGlLm%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><ul list=\"u994af3d8\"><li fid=\"uff6ab94f\" data-lake-id=\"ue97f274f\" id=\"ue97f274f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u14098772\" id=\"u14098772\">参数1：</span><code data-lake-id=\"u150fcfb8\" id=\"u150fcfb8\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7eaf04de\" id=\"u7eaf04de\">uint32_t ulBitsToClearOnEntry</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u33a7efd7\" id=\"u33a7efd7\">\t旧值的指定bit位设为0，置0则不清除</span></li><li fid=\"uff6ab94f\" data-lake-id=\"u835f74f5\" id=\"u835f74f5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u08001db2\" id=\"u08001db2\">参数2：</span><code data-lake-id=\"ucd7fd870\" id=\"ucd7fd870\"><span data-lake-id=\"u493329d5\" id=\"u493329d5\">uint32_t ulBitsToClearOnExit</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u2670eada\" id=\"u2670eada\">\t新值的指定bit位设为0，置0则不清除</span></li><li fid=\"uff6ab94f\" data-lake-id=\"u8ad9a4f8\" id=\"u8ad9a4f8\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud7611f6d\" id=\"ud7611f6d\">参数3：</span><code data-lake-id=\"u43434470\" id=\"u43434470\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucd355a3c\" id=\"ucd355a3c\">uint32_t * pulNotificationValue</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ua145a643\" id=\"ua145a643\">取出通知值的指针，不需要的设置NULL</span></li><li fid=\"uff6ab94f\" data-lake-id=\"u474cc348\" id=\"u474cc348\"><span data-lake-id=\"u28fa26d5\" id=\"u28fa26d5\">参数4：</span><code data-lake-id=\"u2bb37dc8\" id=\"u2bb37dc8\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc094e1c1\" id=\"uc094e1c1\">TickType_t xTicksToWait</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u4983faaa\" id=\"u4983faaa\">\t\t等待时长</span></li><li fid=\"uff6ab94f\" data-lake-id=\"uef53b42f\" id=\"uef53b42f\"><span data-lake-id=\"uce9713bb\" id=\"uce9713bb\">返回： </span><code data-lake-id=\"ube0b047d\" id=\"ube0b047d\"><span data-lake-id=\"ufbec3c74\" id=\"ufbec3c74\">BaseType_t</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ua7272b61\" id=\"ua7272b61\"> \t</span><code data-lake-id=\"uaf39f020\" id=\"uaf39f020\"><span data-lake-id=\"uec2b8ef9\" id=\"uec2b8ef9\">pdTRUE </span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u7bced6b1\" id=\"u7bced6b1\">等待成功 </span><code data-lake-id=\"u37b9f484\" id=\"u37b9f484\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue245104b\" id=\"ue245104b\">pdFALSE </span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u3d24f077\" id=\"u3d24f077\">等待超时</span></li></ul><h3 data-lake-id=\"isQGz\" id=\"isQGz\"><span data-lake-id=\"u686067be\" id=\"u686067be\">作为轻量级事件组</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ua58d5f91\" id=\"ua58d5f91\"><span data-lake-id=\"u261c5d5e\" id=\"u261c5d5e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">使用设置位方式更新任务通知值</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ua065ac88\" id=\"ua065ac88\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0aab9b7f\" id=\"u0aab9b7f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">更新标志位</span></strong></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22c%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23define%20EVENT_BIT(n)%5Ct(1%20%3C%3C%20n)%5Cn%5Cnstatic%20uint32_t%20ulValue%20%3D%200%3B%20%2F%2F%20%E9%80%9A%E7%9F%A5%E5%80%BC%5Ct%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F1%EF%BC%9A%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%E6%8C%87%E5%AE%9A%E6%A0%87%E5%BF%97%E4%BD%8D%5CnxTaskNotify(task2_handler%2C%20EVENT_BIT(ulValue%2B%2B)%2C%20eSetBits)%3B%5Cn%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E6%96%B9%E5%BC%8F2%EF%BC%9A%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%E5%B9%B6%E6%9F%A5%E8%AF%A2%E7%8E%B0%E6%9C%89%E4%BA%8B%E4%BB%B6%E7%BB%84%5Cn%2F%2F%20%E6%8E%A5%E6%94%B6%E6%96%B9%E4%B8%8D%E6%B8%85%E9%9B%B6%E7%9A%84%E6%83%85%E5%86%B5%E4%B8%8B%EF%BC%8C%E6%89%8D%E8%83%BD%E7%9C%8B%E5%88%B0%E4%B8%8A%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E5%80%BC%5Cnuint32_t%20pulPreviousNotifyValue%3B%5CnxTaskNotifyAndQuery(task2_handler%2C%20EVENT_BIT(ulValue%2B%2B)%2C%20eSetBits%2C%20%26pulPreviousNotifyValue)%3B%5Cnprintf(%5C%22pre_value%3A%20%25%23x%5C%5Cn%5C%22%2C%20pulPreviousNotifyValue)%3B%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Atrue%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Night%20Owl%22%2C%22fontSize%22%3A14%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22SwmkJ%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u7481303c\" id=\"u7481303c\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u896aa306\" id=\"u896aa306\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">判定标志位</span></strong></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2